nts to  apply for government loans and open bank  accounts hot-bod help myalgia earlier  people had to travel 50 kilometers to  the nearest town to get the documents  photocopy so I thought now that we have  reliable electricity  why don't I provide the services right  here it saves villagers time and money  and I supplement my own income existing  businesses too are seeing the benefits  of uninterrupted access to power as  night falls many can continue to operate  street vendor Prabhakar pristine also  runs a grocery store he now plans to  invest in a fridge and offer cold drinks  to his customers since we have  electricity my business is definitely  improved my shop can stay open till late  in the night  I get more customers for most villagers  the biggest changes since electricity  arrived are simple street lights  provides safety from wild animals a  priority in this tiger reserve a few  households have now got television sets  providing entertainment and drawing a  large young audience tonight some even  get to attend a coaching class in the  village and to homework in the evening  power that empowers there are now plans  to replicate short Ches smart village  model in other Indian states
 

